<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Carson raises interim shr.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Carson raises interim shr.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 1997 vs proforma half-year ended June 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, (cts)	     12.54	     vs    6.23</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   5.06	     vs    1.88</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   7.73	     vs    2.93</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.67	     vs    1.05</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.59 received  vs    0.04 paid</p>
<p>    Turnover		 33.13	     vs    15.32</p>
<p>Full name: Carson Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said its West African operation, which serves a population base of 150 million and has a ten-year tax-free status, would become a significant contributor to profits.</p>
<p>A relaunch of products was planned for South Africa.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
